ict of Columbia, 2026-08-24 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the conditional taken-down argument and amphitheater example</span></li><li id="src-32" value="32"><a href="/records/preservation-plaintiffs-statement-2026-09-17/">Preservation plaintiffs’ public statement</a> · DC Preservation League, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the plaintiffs’ public position on independent court protection</span></li><li id="src-34" value="34"><a href="/records/action-network-hands-around-kennedy-center-2026-09-18/">Hands Around the Kennedy Center event page</a> · Action Network, 2026-09-18 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the organizer’s invitation to affected constituencies</span></li></ol><h3 class="src-group">Official data</h3><ol class="src-list" start="16"><li id="src-16" value="16"><a href="/records/usc-20-76j-2026-09-19/">20 U.S.C. 76j, duties of the Board</a> · Office of the Law Revision Counsel, 2026-09-19 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the Kennedy Center board’s statutory duties</span></li><li id="src-17" value="17"><a href="/records/usc-20-76l-2026-09-19/">20 U.S.C. 76l, board organization and powers</a> · Office of the Law Revision Counsel, 2026-09-19 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the board’s statutory organization and powers</span></li><li id="src-30" value="30"><a href="/records/public-law-119-21-kennedy-center/">Public Law 119-21, Kennedy Center appropriation</a> · U.S. Government Publishing Office, 2025-07-04 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the amount and availability period of the capital appropriation</span></li></ol><h3 class="src-group">Coverage checked</h3><ol class="src-list" start="19"><li id="src-19" value="19"><a href="/records/abc-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/">ABC News on the notice order</a> · ABC News, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the candidate headline and immediate closure account</span></li><li id="src-20" value="20"><a href="/records/pbs-ap-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/">Associated Press report carried by PBS NewsHour</a> · Associated Press via PBS NewsHour, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the broad major-physical-changes formulation checked against the order</span></li><li id="src-21" value="21"><a href="/records/upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/">UPI on the notice order</a> · UPI, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the reproduced operative sentence of the minute order</span></li><li id="src-22" value="22"><a href="/records/usa-today-kennedy-center-comments-2026-09-16/">USA Today on demolition remarks</a> · USA Today, 2026-09-16 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the September 16 statements put before the court</span></li><li id="src-23" value="23"><a href="/records/usa-today-kennedy-center-order-2026-09-17/">USA Today on the notice order</a> · USA Today, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the immediate-demolition characterization checked against the order</span></li><li id="src-26" value="26"><a href="/records/cbs-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/">CBS News on the demolition dispute</a> · CBS News, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the Kennedy Center spokesperson’s no-demolition statement</span></li><li id="src-33" value="33"><a href="/records/ap-kennedy-center-protest-2026-09-18/">Associated Press report on the Kennedy Center protest</a> · Associated Press, 2026-09-18 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the protest size and human chain</span></li><li id="src-35" value="35"><a href="/records/ap-trump-kennedy-center-2026-09-18/">Associated Press report on Trump’s Kennedy Center remarks</a> · Associated Press, 2026-09-18 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; Trump’s response to a direct demolition question</span></li></ol><p class="sources-line"><a href="/methodology">How we check</a> <spa