ails></article></details><section class="revision-timeline" data-layer="fact" data-revision-confirmations="0" data-revision-changes="0"></section><section data-layer="proof"><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href="/records/board-minutes-68-3-2026-08-13/" data-source-copy>Kennedy Center Board of Trustees</a> · August 13, 2026 · <span data-source-copy>Kennedy Center board meeting minutes</span></li><li><a href="/records/upi-kennedy-center-2026-09-17/" data-source-copy>UPI</a> · September 17, 2026 · <span data-source-copy>UPI on the notice order</span></li></ul></section></main></div><footer class="colophon"><p>Published records carry their review status on the page. Work that has not been published is clearly labeled. Corrections and withdrawals are permanent, dated, and public.</p><p><a href="/">The Catch</a> <a href="/methodology">How we check</a> <a href="/records/">Source library</a></p></footer></div><div id="evidence-preview" class="evidence-preview" popover="manual" role="tooltip"><p class="preview-title"></p><p class="preview-copy"></p><span>Click to read in context</span></div><dialog id="evidence-reader" class="evidence-reader" aria-labelledby="evidence-title"><header class="evidence-toolbar"><span>Source reader</span><div><button type="button" data-expand-evidence aria-label="Expand source reader" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9V4h5m6 0h5v5M4 15v5h5m6 0h5v-5"></path></svg></button><button type="button" data-close-evidence aria-label="Close source reader"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="evidence-identity"><p class="evidence-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><h2 id="evidence-title">Source</h2><p class="evidence-byline"></p><p class="evidence-purpose"></p><div class="evidence-view-controls" hidden><button type="button" data-context-view aria-pressed="true">Passage in context</button><button type="button" data-full-view aria-pressed="false">Full saved text</button></div></div><div class="evidence-scroll"><div class="evidence-text" tabindex="0"></div></div><footer class="evidence-footer"><button type="button" data-close-evidence>Back to reading</button><a data-source-page>Source details</a><a data-saved-page>Saved document ↗</a></footer></dialog><script type="module" src="/_astro/EvidenceReader.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.C3JJvVMO.js"></script></body></html><script type="module" src="/_astro/BaseLayout.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.DSlozcIj.js"></script>
