57-      <div data-layer="proof" class="event-record-context">
58-        <p class="sources-line">This story rests on filings in Beatty v. Trump and D.C. Preservation League v. Trump; the court's May 29 opinions; the board's August meeting record; the August 28 joint report; the September 16 scheduling order; federal statutes governing the Kennedy Center; the September 17 minute order as reproduced in full by UPI and quoted in part by Beatty's counsel; and the coverage records checked against those documents.</p>
